The museum is very quiet.
I walk slowly through the large hall.
Outside the rain is heavy, but here there is peace.
I see ancient objects here.
I read a plaque near the display.
I look at this pot.
This clay pot is very ancient.
People used this pot many centuries ago.
That coin is also there.
That coin is also very ancient.
Many centuries ago, someone bought things with that coin.
Now, that coin is only for display.
My daily routine in Mumbai is very busy.
Was the daily routine of those people also busy?
Those people prepared food in this pot a long time ago.
These objects are from another time.
But those people were like us.
I look at this pot one more time and walk ahead.
